q
1 0 0 1 51.35433 523.4101 cm
%PreformattedPara
.090196 .129412 .168627 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 129.64 Tm /F3 7 Tf 8.54 TL (ALGORITHM RecordSale\(items, sales, itemId, qty\)) Tj T* (    IF qty <= 0 THEN REJECT and RETURN) Tj T* (    item <- FIND itemId) Tj T* (    IF item does not exist THEN REJECT and RETURN) Tj T* (    IF item is COMBO THEN) Tj T* (        VALIDATE all component IDs and required stock) Tj T* (    ELSE) Tj T* (        VALIDATE item.stock >= qty) Tj T* (    END IF) Tj T* (    VALIDATE sales-summary capacity) Tj T* (    IF any validation failed THEN REJECT and RETURN) Tj T* (    DEDUCT stock for item or all combo components) Tj T* (    ADD qty to sales[itemId].quantity) Tj T* (    ADD item.price * qty to sales[itemId].revenue) Tj T* (    DISPLAY sale accepted) Tj T* (END ALGORITHM) Tj T* ET
Q
